Neat Trick Spoiler

	Here's a neat trick I came up with (by accident) recently. My barbarian
was wandering around several levels with several altars all told, and happened
to put on this helm => helm of opposite alignment. Then I enchanted it, and
it was no longer cursed ... Now I can be either lawful or chaotic as the unicorn
or altar demands ... at the drop of a hat! It seems to work pretty well -
anyone else tried this?


